msgstr ""
"[Importa i gestiona transaccions](import-bank-statements.md) - porta més "
"transaccions al ledger."

#: ../../how-to/ledger-evidence.md:114
msgid ""
"[Correct mistakes in your ledger](correct-ledger-entries.md) - fix "
"mistakes in transaction rows."
msgstr ""
"[Corregeix errors al teu ledger](correct-ledger-entries.md) - corregeix "
