#: ../../how-to/ledger-evidence.md:115
msgid ""
"[Classify transactions](classify-transactions.md) - assign tax categories"
" to your transactions."
msgstr ""
"[Classifica transaccions](classify-transactions.md) - assigna categories "
"tributàries a les teves transaccions."

